        {
          "text": "Maze Mpwemu aranterura anjana mu bari mu kinyago i Babiloni, ndi mw’iyerekwa mpawe na Mpwemu w’Imana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.24",
